{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "316eee2b-437b-8a7a-b76d-d02b1c2f6a68",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:11:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. I am calling about, um, the storm drain. In front of my house. It is not working right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address where the drain is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 475 Memorial Boulevard. On the, the Easton's Beach side. Near the corner, but my house is the number, 475."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "475 Memorial Boulevard, by Easton's Beach. Got it. And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, how do you say, gurgling. Like water going down but it, it does not go. And a smell comes up. Sewer smell. Very bad. I open the door and it is in the house almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:07:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not pleasant. Is that since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The storm, last weekend. The nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Since then. And the street, the water stays by the drain. Yesterday, today, still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water's sitting there a full day after the storm ended. Has this drain done this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Always it is slow. Every storm, every big rain, same thing. Nobody comes. I call before, I think, and, [pause] nothing changes. So now again I am calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's aggravating, especially when it keeps happening. Let me write this up. Is the water coming into your house or yard, or just the street and the smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street, and the smell. And the sidewalk, wet. But I worry, if it rains more, it will come to the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So the report is the storm drain in front of 475 Memorial Boulevard is gurgling, has a sewer odor, and has standing water since the nor'easter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly. Please, I want the drain to be cleaned. Somebody must come and clean it, clear it. Not only look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for a crew to inspect and clean it. I can't tell you the exact day, they're backed up after a storm like this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand they are busy. But it is always busy. [pause] I have pictures. I took photos, the water and the drain. I can send them. Is it possible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. Do you have an email, or would you rather I note that photos are available?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email I have, but my daughter, no, I mean, I do not do it so well. Can you write that I have photos, and I send later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that you have photos and will send them. And the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. This is the house phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. Is there a good time to call? Somebody might want to check with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, it is difficult. I work at night. I stock the shelves, in a grocery store, overnight. So in the morning I sleep. After twelve, one o'clock, is better. Like now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so afternoons are best. I'll put that in the notes. If we miss you, we'll leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, leave the message. Thank you. And the smell, if it is a sewer problem, not only the drain, you tell them also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll include that the odor is strong and coming up from the drain, so whoever goes out knows to look at that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Because I do not want to call again and again. This is the, um, the problem that does not finish."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's logged now, afternoons at 401-555-0175, photos to follow. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for listening. I hope somebody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so too, and we'll get it to the crew. Take care, Mrs. Pagan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
